{"id":"0129e327740919d4","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-splitting.md","title":"Stationary-Set Splitting","display":"df-splitting — Stationary-Set Splitting","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-splitting","aliases":["58-df-splitting"],"display":"df-splitting — Stationary-Set Splitting","depends_on":["[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-splitting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-splitting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-splitting — Stationary-Set Splitting"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-splitting-—-Splitting-Number\">df-splitting — Splitting Number</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(S,T,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}\\)</span> (stationary-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Split}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Split}_S\\)</span> (splitting predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}splitting} \\vdash \\mathrm{Split}_S(T,S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land T\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Stationary}(S\\cap T,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Stationary}(S\\setminus T,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}splitting} \\vdash \\mathrm{Split}_S(T,S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land T\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Stationary}(S\\cap T,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Stationary}(S\\setminus T,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is a ternary splitting relation, not the cardinal characteristic usually called the splitting number.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-splitting-—-Splitting-Number","text":"df-splitting — Splitting Number","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-s